  "problem_name": "Second Largest",
  "intended_contest_code": null,
  "body": "<p>\r\n\tThree numbers <b>A</b>, <b>B</b> and <b>C</b> are the inputs. Write a program to find second largest among them.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Input</h3>\r\n<p> \r\n\r\nThe first line contains an integer <b>T</b>, the total number of testcases. Then <b>T</b> lines follow, each line contains three integers <b>A</b>, <b>B</b> and <b>C</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Output</h3>\r\n<p>For each test case, display the second largest among <b>A</b>, <b>B</b> and <b>C</b>, in a new line.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Constraints</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1 <b>\u2264</b> <b>T</b> <b>\u2264</b> 1000</li>\r\n<li>1 <b>\u2264</b> <b>A,B,C</b> <b>\u2264</b> 1000000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Example</h3>\r\n<pre>\r\n<b>Input</b>\r\n3 \r\n120 11 400\r\n10213 312 10\r\n10 3 450\r\n\r\n<b>Output</b>\r\n\r\n120\r\n312\r\n10\r\n</pre>\n<aside style='background: #f8f8f8;padding: 10px 15px;'><div>All submissions for this problem are available.</div></aside>",
